<Layout title="Privacy"><div class="wrap narrow"><PageHeader title="A little less to worry about." kicker="PRIVACY" back="/privacy/" backLabel="Privacy"/><article class="content-panel prose"><p>D.El.Ed Buddy does not require an account. This version has no advertising, analytics, submission forms or student database.</p><h2>What stays on your device</h2><p>Saved resources, unit progress, checklist ticks and your colour preference are stored in this browser’s local storage. They are not synchronized across devices. Clearing browser data removes them.</p><p>Search runs in your browser. No search query is sent to an AI model or search service. Your search appears in the page URL, so a link you share may include it.</p><h2>External services</h2><p>Fonts are requested from Google Fonts. Hosting providers may process ordinary technical request data. A private hosted preview may require the host’s sign-in; D.El.Ed Buddy itself does not create student accounts. External websites and PDF viewers have their own privacy practices.</p><button class="button secondary" id="clear-data">Clear my saved study data</button><p id="clear-status" role="status" class="small spaced"></p><p class="small muted">Updated 24 September 2026.</p></article></div></Layout>
